### Berespro API — quick manual tests (VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP)
@base = http://127.0.0.1:8787
@token = PASTE_ACCESS_TOKEN

### health
GET {{base}}/health

### exchange Firebase token for a session (app does this after Google/phone sign-in)
POST {{base}}/auth/session
Content-Type: application/json

{ "firebaseToken": "PASTE_FIREBASE_ID_TOKEN" }

### me
GET {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### switch to partner mode
PATCH {{base}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "mode": "partner", "skills": ["Handyman","Assembly"] }

### post a task (customer)
POST {{base}}/tasks
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "title":"Assemble IKEA PAX","category":"assembly","city":"Kuala Lumpur","addr":"Mont Kiara","lat":3.171,"lng":101.652,"budget_cents":18000,"date_label":"14 Jul 2026","time_slot":"Morning","description":"12th floor, lift access" }

### partner job feed
GET {{base}}/tasks?lat=3.15&lng=101.66&radius=20&sort=nearest
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### place a bid
POST {{base}}/tasks/TASK_ID/bids
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{ "amount_cents": 17000, "message": "2 hours incl cleanup" }

### connect payout (partner, once) — creates PSP sub-merchant
POST {{base}}/partners/connect
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### accept a bid (customer) — PSP authorizes (holds) funds, returns payment_url
POST {{base}}/bids/BID_ID/accept
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}

### payment status
GET {{base}}/payments/PAYMENT_ID
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
